WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.074
Watch Online Movies and Series for FREE
www.osdb.link/lm

2
00:00:15.833 --> 00:00:17.833
[♪ legendary music playing]

3
00:00:22.875 --> 00:00:23.875
[♪ music ends]

4
00:00:27.958 --> 00:00:29.958
[♪ exhilarating music playing]

5
00:00:59.958 --> 00:01:02.083
All right. Kwana. you ready?

6
00:01:02.167 --> 00:01:04.833
-[Kwana] I'm ready when you are.
-[Gramps] Huh?

7
00:01:04.917 --> 00:01:06.167
Let's move out.

8
00:01:06.250 --> 00:01:08.375
-[Gramps] They've spotted us!
-[Kara grunts]

9
00:01:10.625 --> 00:01:12.417
-[gasps]
-They got here before us.

10
00:01:13.458 --> 00:01:16.542
[Bhozn] Well. well.
you managed to survive.

11
00:01:16.625 --> 00:01:18.417
Quite impressive.

12
00:01:18.500 --> 00:01:21.875
However. we've kept
a nice little counterstrike waiting.

13
00:01:21.958 --> 00:01:23.917
especially for you lot.

14
00:01:24.917 --> 00:01:26.917
[droids whirring]

15
00:01:28.958 --> 00:01:31.125
[Nawaam] <i>All ships</i>
<i>assume attack formation.</i>

16
00:01:31.208 --> 00:01:34.875
Our target... the enemy fleet.

17
00:01:34.958 --> 00:01:36.625
[♪ dramatic music playing]

18
00:01:36.708 --> 00:01:38.125
[hissing. clacking]

19
00:01:40.958 --> 00:01:44.250
No! Stop! They're not warships.
They're carrying civilians!

20
00:01:44.333 --> 00:01:48.208
[grunts] No!
Get us in front of the refugee fleet!

21
00:01:48.292 --> 00:01:49.750
We'll serve as their shield.

22
00:01:49.833 --> 00:01:51.208
[engines revving]

23
00:01:56.292 --> 00:01:57.958
-[distant explosions]
-[all exclaiming]

24
00:01:58.042 --> 00:02:00.500
-[rumbling]
-[whimpering]

25
00:02:01.292 --> 00:02:02.625
[Kwana] Hurry!

26
00:02:02.708 --> 00:02:04.083
[Juro] Curse you. Nawaam.

27
00:02:04.875 --> 00:02:07.167
What a cheap and cowardly move.

28
00:02:07.250 --> 00:02:10.667
You're attacking civilian ships
to try to smoke us out.

29
00:02:14.458 --> 00:02:18.167
[Kwana] All ships form a protective shield
around the refugee convoy

30
00:02:18.250 --> 00:02:19.583
and continue evacuation.

31
00:02:19.667 --> 00:02:21.292
Get out of here.

32
00:02:21.375 --> 00:02:24.042
Use your hyperdrives.
It doesn't matter where you go.

33
00:02:24.125 --> 00:02:26.125
[♪ dramatic music continues playing]

34
00:02:35.708 --> 00:02:38.375
[Bhozn] That big one
must be their flagship.

35
00:02:39.333 --> 00:02:42.792
[Nawaam] All units. close in
on the enemy meteor ships.

36
00:02:44.167 --> 00:02:46.375
We'll bring the fight to them.

37
00:02:46.458 --> 00:02:48.458
[♪ sinister music playing]

38
00:03:01.250 --> 00:03:03.125
[grunts]

39
00:03:03.208 --> 00:03:04.750
[Four-Nines speaking Droid]

40
00:03:10.500 --> 00:03:11.958
[sighs softly]

41
00:03:13.583 --> 00:03:15.042
-[Four-Nines chirps]
-[gasps]

42
00:03:15.833 --> 00:03:17.500
[footsteps approaching]

43
00:03:18.125 --> 00:03:19.208
[Zhima] Can I help you?

44
00:03:20.250 --> 00:03:21.375
I'm here to rescue you.

45
00:03:23.625 --> 00:03:26.375
You're Lah Zhima. Is that right?

46
00:03:26.458 --> 00:03:28.708
-[Four-Nines speaking Droid]
-[clanking]

47
00:03:30.750 --> 00:03:31.875
[gasps. in English] Four-Nines!

48
00:03:32.708 --> 00:03:33.750
And you are?

49
00:03:34.458 --> 00:03:36.250
My name is Ethan. and I'm a friend.

50
00:03:37.208 --> 00:03:39.500
I'm currently training under Master Juro.

51
00:03:43.458 --> 00:03:44.667
I see.

52
00:03:44.750 --> 00:03:47.750
Kara managed to get those lightsabers
to Juro after all.

53
00:03:48.625 --> 00:03:51.500
[lasers firing]

54
00:03:52.542 --> 00:03:54.292
[Nawaam] I sense something.

55
00:03:54.375 --> 00:03:56.583
Could that be one of the Margrave's party?

56
00:03:56.667 --> 00:03:59.042
[alarm beeping]

57
00:03:59.125 --> 00:04:00.500
[Gramps] We're gonna crash!

58
00:04:00.583 --> 00:04:02.750
Get ready to brace for impact!

59
00:04:02.833 --> 00:04:04.833
-[grunting]
-[whimpers]

60
00:04:04.917 --> 00:04:06.917
[crashing]

61
00:04:08.875 --> 00:04:11.500
[all grunting]

62
00:04:14.542 --> 00:04:16.542
[♪ dramatic music playing]

63
00:04:17.500 --> 00:04:18.500
Alert!

64
00:04:18.583 --> 00:04:22.542
The enemy has breached the outer wall
and has entered level two. passage seven.

65
00:04:22.625 --> 00:04:25.167
All hands. prepare for a firefight.

66
00:04:25.250 --> 00:04:26.750
Don't let them get to the bridge.

67
00:04:26.833 --> 00:04:28.833
I sense a presence.

68
00:04:28.917 --> 00:04:30.750
What? Is it Sith?

69
00:04:30.833 --> 00:04:33.667
[gasps] The one from Makoma Ko?

70
00:04:34.542 --> 00:04:35.542
No.

71
00:04:36.958 --> 00:04:38.125
Huh?

72
00:04:41.208 --> 00:04:44.542
[grunting]

73
00:04:45.125 --> 00:04:47.000
[gasps] What?

74
00:04:47.750 --> 00:04:48.833
I'm sorry.

75
00:04:48.917 --> 00:04:52.458
However. I'm afraid
that I am unable to leave this place.

76
00:04:52.542 --> 00:04:53.958
At least not yet.

77
00:04:54.542 --> 00:04:56.417
But now's our chance.

78
00:04:56.500 --> 00:05:01.042
Nawaam has deployed most of his forces.
so there's hardly anyone aboard right now.

79
00:05:01.125 --> 00:05:04.250
But that would mean
he's planning on taking out Bibin.

80
00:05:04.833 --> 00:05:06.833
-Yes.
-[Zhima] So be it.

81
00:05:08.125 --> 00:05:11.292
Ethan. you said it was?
You'll want to step aside.

82
00:05:11.875 --> 00:05:13.000
Huh?

83
00:05:19.750 --> 00:05:21.625
[rumbling]

84
00:05:23.500 --> 00:05:25.583
[crashes]

85
00:05:27.708 --> 00:05:31.042
[whooshes. thuds]

86
00:05:34.208 --> 00:05:35.208
Come with me.

87
00:05:39.958 --> 00:05:41.250
[both groan]

88
00:05:42.792 --> 00:05:44.750
-[grunts]
-[clanks]

89
00:05:45.500 --> 00:05:47.542
-[all groaning]
-[lasers firing]

90
00:05:51.208 --> 00:05:54.208
Oh. no. The enemy
is now heading for the engine room.

91
00:05:54.292 --> 00:05:57.333
They're attempting to attack us
where they think we're the weakest.

92
00:05:57.417 --> 00:06:00.125
You're wrong.
I don't think that's it at all.

93
00:06:00.208 --> 00:06:03.708
Think about what would happen if they
blew up the hyperdrive or fuel tank.

94
00:06:04.583 --> 00:06:07.417
The entire ship would then be blown apart.

95
00:06:07.500 --> 00:06:09.833
It seems that they've really
thought of everything.

96
00:06:09.917 --> 00:06:12.208
Then we'll stop them. [grunts]

97
00:06:13.917 --> 00:06:15.833
[sighs softly]

98
00:06:15.917 --> 00:06:18.792
I need you to stay here. You're in charge.

99
00:06:20.458 --> 00:06:21.750
Juro.

100
00:06:22.417 --> 00:06:26.250
Homen. Kwana. we're going to
go out there and join the fray.

101
00:06:26.333 --> 00:06:27.333
Are you ready?

102
00:06:27.417 --> 00:06:28.667
Yes.

103
00:06:29.250 --> 00:06:30.625
You bet.

104
00:06:32.583 --> 00:06:34.875
-[grunts]
-[all exclaim]

105
00:06:34.958 --> 00:06:36.292
[all groaning]

106
00:06:36.375 --> 00:06:37.667
-[chuckles]
-[lasers firing]

107
00:06:37.750 --> 00:06:39.000
[gasps]

108
00:06:40.583 --> 00:06:41.583
[grunts]

109
00:06:44.625 --> 00:06:46.083
Remain calm!

110
00:06:46.167 --> 00:06:48.750
Our target is just up ahead. [grunts]

111
00:06:49.333 --> 00:06:51.292
[♪ dramatic music playing]

112
00:06:52.250 --> 00:06:55.667
-[grunts]
-[Kwana groans] Well. this is a letdown.

113
00:06:55.750 --> 00:06:59.375
I was really hoping you'd have
put up more of a fight.

114
00:06:59.458 --> 00:07:02.333
-[footsteps approaching]
-[grunts]

115
00:07:03.875 --> 00:07:05.167
[lightsaber buzzing]

116
00:07:07.625 --> 00:07:08.625
[grunts]

117
00:07:10.667 --> 00:07:13.208
In any case. prepare yourselves.

118
00:07:14.083 --> 00:07:15.167
[grunting]

119
00:07:16.542 --> 00:07:18.833
So this is Nawaam's army.

120
00:07:18.917 --> 00:07:20.417
Let's see what you're made of.

121
00:07:26.333 --> 00:07:27.708
[gasps]

122
00:07:32.000 --> 00:07:34.625
Hold on.
Someone's attacking from another route.

123
00:07:35.583 --> 00:07:36.917
Inform the engine room.

124
00:07:37.625 --> 00:07:38.625
No. wait!

125
00:07:39.375 --> 00:07:42.667
The path they're taking
leads them straight here.

126
00:07:42.750 --> 00:07:44.208
-The bridge.
-[gasps]

127
00:07:47.583 --> 00:07:49.583
[♪ sinister music playing]

128
00:07:51.125 --> 00:07:52.542
-[explosion]
-[crackling]

129
00:07:54.625 --> 00:07:56.958
[lights popping. crackling]

130
00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:01.708
-[grunts]
-[Gramps] Where are you going?

131
00:08:03.458 --> 00:08:05.417
Well. I don't plan
on fighting him in here.

132
00:08:05.500 --> 00:08:08.667
You're gonna go out there
and fight them by yourself?

133
00:08:08.750 --> 00:08:11.875
Juro wanted me to protect the bridge.
so that's what I'm going to do.

134
00:08:12.917 --> 00:08:13.917
Don't worry.

135
00:08:15.958 --> 00:08:17.542
[crashes]

136
00:08:20.083 --> 00:08:22.125
-[lights pop. crackle]
-[panting]

137
00:08:24.292 --> 00:08:25.292
[grunts softly]

138
00:08:27.167 --> 00:08:29.167
[♪ sinister music playing]

139
00:08:30.708 --> 00:08:32.708
[footsteps approaching]

140
00:08:36.792 --> 00:08:38.667
[popping. crackling]

141
00:08:38.750 --> 00:08:41.625
-[footsteps approaching]
-[inhales]

142
00:08:46.542 --> 00:08:48.583
[lightsaber buzzing]

143
00:08:48.667 --> 00:08:50.542
-[lasers firing]
-[grunting]

144
00:08:50.625 --> 00:08:52.042
[gasps] Nawaam!

145
00:08:52.125 --> 00:08:55.583
[grunting] I'm sorry.
I must leave the rest to you.

146
00:08:55.667 --> 00:08:57.500
-Go!
-Why? What happened?

147
00:09:00.542 --> 00:09:04.750
[shudders] Wait are...you a...Jedi?

148
00:09:05.875 --> 00:09:07.208
-[grunts]
-[Nawaam] Jedi?

149
00:09:08.208 --> 00:09:09.833
Jedi... Sith...

150
00:09:09.917 --> 00:09:12.667
These are archaic words
for someone so young.

151
00:09:14.708 --> 00:09:16.417
The Jedi are everlasting.

152
00:09:17.125 --> 00:09:18.750
[buzzes]

153
00:09:18.833 --> 00:09:20.875
There's nothing archaic about them.

154
00:09:21.750 --> 00:09:23.083
[Nawaam] I see.

155
00:09:23.167 --> 00:09:25.958
You must be Lah Zhima's daughter then.

156
00:09:26.042 --> 00:09:28.583
The one who caught old Gennoh off guard.

157
00:09:29.250 --> 00:09:30.833
And what about you?

158
00:09:30.917 --> 00:09:32.792
How do you know my father?

159
00:09:33.542 --> 00:09:36.000
[Nawaam] Allow me to introduce myself.

160
00:09:36.083 --> 00:09:37.667
My name is Nawaam.

161
00:09:37.750 --> 00:09:41.000
Lord Lah Zhima is the one I call master.

162
00:09:41.083 --> 00:09:42.583
What are you saying?

163
00:09:42.667 --> 00:09:44.875
My father would have
mentioned an apprentice.

164
00:09:44.958 --> 00:09:46.708
[Nawaam] Would you like
to see for yourself?

165
00:09:47.583 --> 00:09:49.292
[Kara] Don't be ridiculous.

166
00:09:50.125 --> 00:09:51.833
I'm my father's only Padawan.

167
00:09:52.750 --> 00:09:54.083
There have been no others.

168
00:09:55.000 --> 00:09:59.125
I don't know why you're lying to me.
but you're going to give him back.

169
00:09:59.208 --> 00:10:01.792
[Nawaam] Lord Zhima
will not return to you.

170
00:10:01.875 --> 00:10:04.542
[grunting]

171
00:10:06.417 --> 00:10:09.167
-[Nawaam] Hmm.
-[Kara yelling]

172
00:10:09.250 --> 00:10:11.250
[lightsabers crackling]

173
00:10:15.208 --> 00:10:17.958
[Kara grunting]

174
00:10:18.042 --> 00:10:19.458
[gasps]

175
00:10:19.542 --> 00:10:21.833
-[crackling]
-[grunts softly]

176
00:10:21.917 --> 00:10:23.167
[gasps. grunts]

177
00:10:23.250 --> 00:10:24.917
[whooshing. creaking]

178
00:10:28.417 --> 00:10:30.625
[grunts. pants]

179
00:10:33.542 --> 00:10:35.333
[panting]

180
00:10:39.333 --> 00:10:40.333
[Nawaam] Impressive.

181
00:10:40.417 --> 00:10:43.708
I should have expected no less
from my master's daughter.

182
00:10:44.542 --> 00:10:46.583
Sticking to your lies?

183
00:10:46.667 --> 00:10:47.750
When was it then?

184
00:10:47.833 --> 00:10:50.542
When did my father take you on
as an apprentice?

185
00:10:50.625 --> 00:10:53.000
Because this is the first
I've ever heard of it.

186
00:10:54.083 --> 00:10:56.917
[Nawaam] I never said I learned
from his direct teachings.

187
00:10:58.333 --> 00:11:00.125
He taught me an invaluable lesson

188
00:11:00.208 --> 00:11:04.000
when I saw him cut down
his own master. Reno Tsutara.

189
00:11:06.125 --> 00:11:10.417
<i>It was then that I decided</i>
<i>to follow Lord Zhima as my master.</i>

190
00:11:11.625 --> 00:11:12.958
[whooshes]

191
00:11:14.042 --> 00:11:16.667
[Nawaam] I remember... at that moment.

192
00:11:16.750 --> 00:11:19.542
the urge to kill. the will to fight.

193
00:11:20.583 --> 00:11:23.292
and even all traces of mercy
for Reno vanished.

194
00:11:24.375 --> 00:11:27.083
All of his emotions disappeared.

195
00:11:27.167 --> 00:11:31.000
leaving only an endless void
and nothingness.

196
00:11:35.833 --> 00:11:37.333
[buzzes]

197
00:11:40.417 --> 00:11:42.042
[explosion]

198
00:11:51.750 --> 00:11:53.042
[lightsaber buzzes]

199
00:11:55.750 --> 00:11:57.625
[Kara gasps. grunting]

200
00:12:05.292 --> 00:12:07.875
[grunting]

201
00:12:10.292 --> 00:12:12.458
-[grunts]
-[lightsabers crackling]

202
00:12:17.458 --> 00:12:18.583
[Kara grunting]

203
00:12:21.000 --> 00:12:22.667
[yelling]

204
00:12:24.625 --> 00:12:25.792
Huh?

205
00:12:27.292 --> 00:12:28.958
[clunking]

206
00:12:35.667 --> 00:12:37.458
[shatters]

207
00:12:38.458 --> 00:12:39.458
Hold on.

208
00:12:40.208 --> 00:12:41.208
How old are you?

209
00:12:42.292 --> 00:12:45.292
Did you actually see my father
strike down his own master?

210
00:12:46.417 --> 00:12:47.417
[Nawaam] I did.

211
00:12:48.167 --> 00:12:49.750
With my very own eyes.

212
00:12:55.125 --> 00:12:56.792
[♪ somber music playing]

213
00:13:04.042 --> 00:13:05.042
[lasers firing]

214
00:13:26.250 --> 00:13:29.500
[Nawaam] That's when I vowed to walk
the path towards ultimate strength.

215
00:13:30.458 --> 00:13:32.417
To achieve that state of nothingness.

216
00:13:33.417 --> 00:13:35.833
The ideal state achieved by Lord Zhima.

217
00:13:35.917 --> 00:13:37.750
What's so ideal about it?

218
00:13:38.542 --> 00:13:39.542
[Nawaam] How sad.

219
00:13:40.583 --> 00:13:43.583
I see you've been tainted
by Jedi teachings.

220
00:13:43.667 --> 00:13:46.042
I shall show you what true power is.

221
00:13:47.167 --> 00:13:50.458
A long time ago. I left a deep scar
on the heart of a young child.

222
00:13:50.542 --> 00:13:52.208
warping his view of the world.

223
00:13:52.292 --> 00:13:54.583
It ended up sending him on the wrong path.

224
00:13:54.667 --> 00:13:59.500
And now it is my duty to counteract
the trauma the past has caused.

225
00:13:59.583 --> 00:14:02.042
I'm not sure I know what you mean.

226
00:14:02.625 --> 00:14:04.125
[whirring]

227
00:14:05.583 --> 00:14:06.667
Enough stories.

228
00:14:06.750 --> 00:14:09.667
Right now. we have to get
to Juro and Kara quickly.

229
00:14:09.750 --> 00:14:11.917
And then find a way
to stop Nawaam's attack.

230
00:14:12.000 --> 00:14:13.250
[both gasp]

231
00:14:13.917 --> 00:14:16.708
[Gennoh] Well. if it isn't Lord Zhima.

232
00:14:16.792 --> 00:14:18.208
Heading off somewhere?

233
00:14:20.500 --> 00:14:22.375
[lightsabers whooshing. crackling]

234
00:14:28.625 --> 00:14:30.542
[crashes]

235
00:14:32.583 --> 00:14:33.708
[breathes heavily]

236
00:14:34.417 --> 00:14:36.625
Your emotions have
too much control over you.

237
00:14:39.333 --> 00:14:41.250
-[Kara gasps]
-[lightsabers crackling]

238
00:14:41.333 --> 00:14:42.958
[Kara grunting]

239
00:14:44.583 --> 00:14:47.167
-[Nawaam] That is why your blade wavers.
-[Kara yelps]

240
00:14:48.042 --> 00:14:49.292
-[cracking]
-[gasps]

241
00:14:50.750 --> 00:14:52.125
[gasping]

242
00:14:53.208 --> 00:14:54.542
[grunts]

243
00:14:57.458 --> 00:14:58.833
[groans]

244
00:15:00.875 --> 00:15:02.333
[grunting]

245
00:15:04.500 --> 00:15:07.083
[groaning]

246
00:15:07.167 --> 00:15:09.708
-[hissing]
-[Kara whimpering]

247
00:15:10.667 --> 00:15:12.625
[grunting]

248
00:15:14.167 --> 00:15:15.792
[gasps]

249
00:15:16.958 --> 00:15:18.250
-[distant crash]
-Huh?

250
00:15:18.333 --> 00:15:19.875
-[crashes]
-[Kara gasps]

251
00:15:23.417 --> 00:15:24.583
Juro!

252
00:15:25.417 --> 00:15:27.417
This one is strong with the Force.

253
00:15:27.500 --> 00:15:29.667
Kara. you have to get out of here.

254
00:15:29.750 --> 00:15:33.625
[Kara] No! I'm going to make him tell me
where my father is!

255
00:15:33.708 --> 00:15:35.375
Get out of here!

256
00:15:35.458 --> 00:15:37.708
-[Nawaam] Margrave Juro.
-[Kara grunts]

257
00:15:39.125 --> 00:15:41.917
I never imagined I would do battle
with a true Jedi.

258
00:15:43.625 --> 00:15:45.958
[grunting]

259
00:15:46.042 --> 00:15:50.250
And I never imagined
that the famed general would be so young.

260
00:15:50.333 --> 00:15:53.542
Do you wear your mask
to conceal your youth?

261
00:15:53.625 --> 00:15:55.958
-[Nawaam] What a boring question.
-[lightsabers crackling]

262
00:15:56.042 --> 00:15:58.292
I use the mask to return to nothingness.

263
00:15:59.458 --> 00:16:01.792
A cage to discipline my mind.

264
00:16:01.875 --> 00:16:07.000
-"Return to nothingness"?
-Lord Lah Zhima attained nothingness.

265
00:16:07.083 --> 00:16:09.000
I wish to achieve the state myself.

266
00:16:09.083 --> 00:16:10.583
Enough with your lies!

267
00:16:10.667 --> 00:16:12.333
My father isn't nothing.

268
00:16:13.917 --> 00:16:17.083
Movements driven by rage
gives your enemy openings.

269
00:16:17.167 --> 00:16:18.167
Shut up!

270
00:16:19.875 --> 00:16:22.250
Kara! [grunts]

271
00:16:25.792 --> 00:16:27.292
Your moves are skilled.

272
00:16:27.375 --> 00:16:32.542
However. try as you might.
no Jedi can take me down.

273
00:16:32.625 --> 00:16:34.500
[grunting]

274
00:16:36.958 --> 00:16:38.792
-[gasps]
-[whooshes]

275
00:16:38.875 --> 00:16:40.875
[Juro groans]

276
00:16:46.125 --> 00:16:50.000
[winces. chokes]

277
00:16:50.083 --> 00:16:52.083
[♪ dramatic music playing]

278
00:16:55.542 --> 00:16:56.875
[gasps]

279
00:16:58.417 --> 00:17:00.125
[sighing] Juro...

280
00:17:02.583 --> 00:17:05.500
Had you attained Lord Lah Zhima's
state of nothingness.

281
00:17:05.583 --> 00:17:08.792
you would not have allowed
your Padawan to distract you.

282
00:17:08.875 --> 00:17:09.958
[winces]

283
00:17:10.042 --> 00:17:11.917
[screaming] Enough!

284
00:17:12.000 --> 00:17:14.042
-[grunts]
-[Juro groans softly]

285
00:17:14.125 --> 00:17:15.625
[crackling]

286
00:17:16.875 --> 00:17:17.958
[breathes heavily]

287
00:17:20.833 --> 00:17:22.958
[both yelping. groaning]

288
00:17:30.875 --> 00:17:31.958
[weakly] Please run.

289
00:17:33.042 --> 00:17:34.833
Don't make me repeat myself.

290
00:17:35.500 --> 00:17:37.625
Juro! I won't leave you here.

291
00:17:39.292 --> 00:17:43.458
Listen. Kara.
you are filled with kindness.

292
00:17:43.542 --> 00:17:44.792
[breath trembling]

293
00:17:44.875 --> 00:17:47.333
Do your best to always remember that.

294
00:17:48.292 --> 00:17:52.208
If you do.
you will one day achieve true strength.

295
00:17:52.292 --> 00:17:54.125
[gasps softly]

296
00:17:57.667 --> 00:17:59.417
Here. This is yours.

297
00:18:01.083 --> 00:18:03.833
[whimpers]

298
00:18:04.583 --> 00:18:07.208
[sobbing]

299
00:18:09.042 --> 00:18:10.917
[sobs. sniffles]

300
00:18:14.417 --> 00:18:15.417
Juro...

301
00:18:21.792 --> 00:18:25.167
[Kara sobs]

302
00:18:27.042 --> 00:18:30.458
[screaming] Juro! [sobbing]

303
00:18:31.083 --> 00:18:32.458
What was that?

304
00:18:32.542 --> 00:18:34.292
What happened to my Master Juro?

305
00:18:35.167 --> 00:18:37.833
Ethan. I will take care
of what I can here.

306
00:18:37.917 --> 00:18:40.792
You need to get out of here
as fast as you can.

307
00:18:40.875 --> 00:18:44.917
Escape and do your best to rescue
as many of your friends as possible.

308
00:18:45.000 --> 00:18:46.250
Hold on a minute.

309
00:18:47.083 --> 00:18:51.375
And. Ethan. please save my daughter. Kara.

310
00:18:51.458 --> 00:18:53.208
[grunts softly]

311
00:18:53.292 --> 00:18:54.417
Right.

312
00:18:54.500 --> 00:18:57.292
Before I go. please take this.

313
00:19:00.958 --> 00:19:03.167
[Gennoh] Are you done
saying your goodbyes?

314
00:19:03.958 --> 00:19:07.583
Unlike yourself.
that brat isn't any sort of guest of ours.

315
00:19:08.458 --> 00:19:10.833
And I'm not obligated to let him leave.

316
00:19:10.917 --> 00:19:15.833
But as a courtesy to you. Lord Zhima.
I'll let him live if you beg.

317
00:19:16.417 --> 00:19:19.083
Oh? And how will you stop him?

318
00:19:19.167 --> 00:19:21.542
If you stop talking and let him go.

319
00:19:21.625 --> 00:19:24.792
maybe I'll extend you the courtesy
of sparing your life.

320
00:19:24.875 --> 00:19:27.042
[Gennoh] Quite a threat for a sabersmith.

321
00:19:27.917 --> 00:19:29.125
Fire.

322
00:19:29.833 --> 00:19:33.042
-[droids grunt]
-Go. Now!

323
00:19:33.125 --> 00:19:34.125
[Ethan] Right.

324
00:19:38.458 --> 00:19:40.625
-[lasers firing]
-[gasps] Four-Nines?

325
00:19:43.083 --> 00:19:44.542
[whirring. crackling]

326
00:19:48.167 --> 00:19:49.333
[thuds]

327
00:19:55.625 --> 00:19:57.417
[speaking Droid]

328
00:19:58.250 --> 00:19:59.917
[gasps]

329
00:20:00.000 --> 00:20:02.625
[in English] I understand.
Protect Master Zhima.

330
00:20:02.708 --> 00:20:04.833
[powering up]

331
00:20:06.292 --> 00:20:07.292
[sighs]

332
00:20:10.750 --> 00:20:13.583
[energy whooshing]

333
00:20:17.042 --> 00:20:19.417
[Gennoh] What is happening to that blade?

334
00:20:20.875 --> 00:20:21.875
[Four-Nines speaking Droid]

335
00:20:25.417 --> 00:20:27.583
[in English] I swore to myself
I'd never draw you again.

336
00:20:33.417 --> 00:20:35.000
[Gennoh] Interesting.

337
00:20:36.542 --> 00:20:38.958
[whooshes]

338
00:20:41.458 --> 00:20:43.917
[sobs. grunts]

339
00:20:48.625 --> 00:20:50.667
It's like what happened before.

340
00:20:50.750 --> 00:20:52.083
[Kara] Don't touch that.

341
00:20:52.167 --> 00:20:55.958
[screaming] It isn't yours! [grunting]

342
00:20:56.042 --> 00:20:57.542
-[energy trilling]
-[grunting]

343
00:21:01.958 --> 00:21:04.375
[energy whooshes]

344
00:21:05.458 --> 00:21:07.417
[buzzing]

345
00:21:09.833 --> 00:21:12.042
[gasps] It turned silver.

346
00:21:12.833 --> 00:21:15.542
The silver glow from the saber...

347
00:21:15.625 --> 00:21:18.250
it's the same
as the light I saw that very day.

348
00:21:21.833 --> 00:21:23.292
What are you saying?

349
00:21:24.167 --> 00:21:25.292
[Nawaam] Don't you get it?

350
00:21:26.042 --> 00:21:31.042
This is a lightsaber forged by Lord Zhima.
which reflects the user's heart.

351
00:21:32.333 --> 00:21:33.625
Is that not right?

352
00:21:34.292 --> 00:21:36.333
I still don't understand.

353
00:21:36.417 --> 00:21:38.292
[Nawaam] The silver light means

354
00:21:38.375 --> 00:21:43.333
I have already achieved the level
that Lord Zhima did on that fateful day.

355
00:21:44.000 --> 00:21:45.875
This is beyond Jedi or Sith.

356
00:21:45.958 --> 00:21:49.167
It's proof of a power
that can bring peace to the galaxy.

357
00:21:52.125 --> 00:21:54.708
I won't allow you to conquer the galaxy.

358
00:21:54.792 --> 00:21:56.583
Not with one of my father's blades.

359
00:21:58.917 --> 00:22:00.417
All right.

360
00:22:00.500 --> 00:22:02.083
Then see for yourself.

361
00:22:04.750 --> 00:22:06.250
[grunts. gasps]

362
00:22:06.333 --> 00:22:07.792
[grunts]

363
00:22:07.875 --> 00:22:08.875
[gasps]

364
00:22:09.875 --> 00:22:11.708
[straining]

365
00:22:11.792 --> 00:22:13.917
[lightsabers crackling]

366
00:22:14.000 --> 00:22:16.625
[grunting]

367
00:22:16.708 --> 00:22:19.125
[whirring]

368
00:22:22.958 --> 00:22:24.833
[lasers firing]

369
00:22:25.917 --> 00:22:27.583
Retreat! Fall back!

370
00:22:30.000 --> 00:22:33.167
[grunts] Hold on. Where are you going?

371
00:22:33.250 --> 00:22:34.292
[grunts]

372
00:22:34.375 --> 00:22:36.750
Hey. doesn't something seem off to you?

373
00:22:38.000 --> 00:22:39.458
Hmm.

374
00:22:48.167 --> 00:22:49.292
[gasps]

375
00:22:49.375 --> 00:22:51.750
[explosion]

376
00:22:52.417 --> 00:22:53.833
[Kara yelps]

377
00:22:54.792 --> 00:22:56.167
[exclaims]

378
00:22:56.750 --> 00:22:58.125
[screams]

379
00:23:04.875 --> 00:23:08.292
-[rumbling]
-Damn it! All hands. evacuate!

380
00:23:10.958 --> 00:23:12.958
[rumbling]

381
00:23:18.792 --> 00:23:22.083
Move it! This place is going to blow!

382
00:23:22.167 --> 00:23:24.333
Hey. where's Kara and Juro?

383
00:23:24.417 --> 00:23:25.500
Have you seen them?

384
00:23:25.583 --> 00:23:27.417
[Gramps] I assumed they were here already.

385
00:23:27.500 --> 00:23:29.500
-[rumbling]
-[distant explosions]

386
00:23:39.958 --> 00:23:42.333
Hold on. We're waiting for Kara and Juro.

387
00:23:42.417 --> 00:23:45.000
[Gramps] It's gonna take more than this
to kill those two.

388
00:23:45.083 --> 00:23:47.333
You guys are a different story.

389
00:23:47.417 --> 00:23:50.958
And if I don't save your hide.
that girl will never forgive me.

390
00:23:51.042 --> 00:23:53.458
Hmm. [grunts]

391
00:23:53.542 --> 00:23:55.667
-[explosion]
-[powering up]

392
00:24:04.750 --> 00:24:08.042
[Juro] <i>Wake up. Kara. Open your eyes.</i>

393
00:24:09.583 --> 00:24:12.167
-[distant explosion]
-[grunts softly]

394
00:24:13.208 --> 00:24:14.458
[groans]

395
00:24:18.125 --> 00:24:19.667
[weakly] Juro...

396
00:24:20.292 --> 00:24:21.500
[groans. sighs]

397
00:24:23.500 --> 00:24:25.458
-[distant explosions]
-[whooshes]

398
00:24:28.125 --> 00:24:30.167
[rumbling]

399
00:24:31.833 --> 00:24:33.833
[groaning weakly]

400
00:24:33.917 --> 00:24:35.958
-[explosion]
-[yelps]

401
00:24:36.042 --> 00:24:38.208
[powering up]

402
00:24:40.750 --> 00:24:43.500
-[explosions continue]
-[sighs]

403
00:24:49.542 --> 00:24:51.125
[screams]

404
00:24:51.208 --> 00:24:53.083
[groans]

405
00:24:58.250 --> 00:25:00.333
[ships jumping to hyperspace]

406
00:25:04.375 --> 00:25:07.500
Uh... Hmm.

407
00:25:07.583 --> 00:25:10.458
[droid] All of their meteor ships
have been destroyed.

408
00:25:10.542 --> 00:25:15.292
However. it appears a number
of their crew have escaped.

409
00:25:15.375 --> 00:25:17.000
Do you want to go after them?

410
00:25:17.083 --> 00:25:18.417
Leave them be.

411
00:25:19.125 --> 00:25:23.625
Their forces have already been decimated
and their leader. Juro. is no more.

412
00:25:24.833 --> 00:25:26.125
Dispatch the Hunters.

413
00:25:27.042 --> 00:25:29.125
Have them dispose of the remaining Jedi.

414
00:25:32.250 --> 00:25:35.833
What I must do now is conquer the galaxy.

415
00:25:35.917 --> 00:25:37.917
[♪ dramatic music playing]

416
00:25:44.917 --> 00:25:46.542
[gasps]

417
00:25:48.250 --> 00:25:49.750
[Ethan] Juro! Kara!

418
00:25:50.583 --> 00:25:51.708
Homen!

419
00:25:51.792 --> 00:25:53.500
Anyone. please come in!

420
00:25:54.417 --> 00:25:55.917
[whooshes]

421
00:25:57.042 --> 00:25:59.042
[♪ dramatic music continues playing]

422
00:26:11.292 --> 00:26:12.958
[♪ music concludes]

423
00:26:13.042 --> 00:26:15.042
[♪ theme music playing]

424
00:26:16.305 --> 00:27:16.274
